---
import HeatmapLogo from '../../../components/studies/HeatmapLogo.astro';
import SiteLayout from '../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout title="Heatmap logo study" description="Study of a heat-field treatment for the Ø logo.">
  <meta slot="head" name="robots" content="noindex" />
  <section class="container page-section study">
    <p class="terminal-label">Study / heatmap logo</p>
    <h1 class="page-title" data-fit>Heat field Ø</h1>
    <p class="lead">A shader fills the Ø silhouette with slow drifting heat in grayscale, peaking at the white accent. The pointer or keyboard focus adds local heat that blooms and cools. Reduced motion and browsers without WebGL get a still frame.</p>

    <div class="layout">
      <figure class="hero terminal-panel bracketed" data-heat-host>
        <HeatmapLogo glow={0.4} />
        <figcaption class="terminal-label">Hero scale / hover to add heat</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="side">
        <h2 class="section-title" data-no-reveal>Nav scale</h2>
        <p class="lead">The same effect at 48px in a header bar. It runs slower at small sizes so it reads as warmth, not flicker. Tab to it to see the focus heat.</p>
        <div class="bar terminal-panel">
          <a class="mark terminal-panel" href="/" aria-label="Soren Gabor, Home" data-heat-host>
            <HeatmapLogo speed={0.6} glow={0.25} />
          </a>
          <span class="ticks" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <nav aria-label="Study navigation"><a class="terminal-control" href="/work/">Work</a><a class="terminal-control" href="/about/">About</a></nav>
        </div>
        <ul class="notes terminal-label" role="list">
          <li>Silhouette from images/o.png, no extra asset</li>
          <li>Ramp: #1a1a1a to #ffffff, five stops</li>
          <li>Pauses off-screen and in hidden tabs</li>
          <li>Cost: one small WebGL canvas per logo</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .study .lead { margin-block: var(--space-2) var(--space-4); }
  .layout { display: grid; gap: var(--space-4); align-items: start; }
  .hero { margin: 0; padding: var(--space-3); max-inline-size: 34rem; }
  .hero figcaption { margin-block-start: var(--space-2); }
  .side { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2); max-inline-size: 40rem; }
  .side .lead { margin-block: 0; }
  .bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2); }
  .mark { display: block; flex: none; inline-size: 3rem; block-size: 3rem; padding: 0.25rem; }
  .mark:focus-visible { outline-offset: 2px; }
  .ticks { flex: 1; block-size: 0.375rem; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-rule) 0 1px, transparent 1px 0.5rem); }
  .bar nav { display: flex; gap: var(--space-1); }
  .notes { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 0.25rem; }
  @media (min-width: 60rem) { .layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); } }
</style>
